      <title>92%商业地产AI试点为何止步生产：工程 postmortem</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260901/92%E5%95%86%E4%B8%9A%E5%9C%B0%E4%BA%A7AI%E8%AF%95%E7%82%B9%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E6%AD%A2%E6%AD%A5%E7%94%9F%E4%BA%A7%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B-postmortem/</link>
